      "writtenOn": "2019-03-16T11:05:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Reasonable, change it accordingly.\nBut I wonder if we should let user know rcode when the answer does not contain any IP addresses.",
      "parentUuid": "168c038a_a786d8b0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 312,
        "startChar": 35,
        "endLine": 312,
